..!interpreter declaration english translate
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : EDICENTER.EV
.. Datum          : 12.08.2003
.. Version        :
.. Autor          : ok
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      :
.. Funktion       : Initialisieren Startwerte, Icons definieren
..
.. Schnittstelle (Parameter und ihre Bedeutung)
..   verwendet Arrayparameter (arg.i)          : nein
..   verwendet Namensparameter (xpname=wert)   : nein
..
.. Ablauf         : Maskeneintritts-FOP
..
.. Functionality  : initialize start values, define icons
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..   uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..   uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
.. Program flow   : mask entry efop
...Includes       :
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. icons definieren
.formula M|datumv     = "."
.formula M|datumb     = "."
.formula M|rotz       = G|icoerror
.formula M|gruenz     = G|icook
.formula M|gelbz      = G|icowarn
.formula M|blauz      = G|icomessage
.formula M|orangez    = "icon:ball_grey"
.formula M|sperrez    = "icon:stop"
.formula M|freiz      = "icon:ok"
.formula M|ledidruckz = "icon:print"
.formula M|lprotz     = "icon:text"
.formula M|lbearbz    = "icon:screen_edit"
.formula M|lexportz   = "icon:arrow_blue_right"
.formula M|limportz   = "icon:arrow_blue_left"
.formula M|llockz     = "icon:bulb_off"
.formula M|lolockz    = "icon:bulb_on"
.formula M|khistoriez = "icon:icecube"
..
.. Hiding automotive fields
.formula M|kbautomotive = F|regmatch('P|maskkontextfop', ".*FOP_automotive.*")
.. if automotive is set in company configuration, default to automotive=true
.formula M|kbautomotive = true ? F|sysinfo(18)^automotive
.input "EDICENTER.KBAUTOMOTIVE.FA"
..
.. Settings?
.formula M|kurlleer =""
.input "EDICENTER.EINSTELLUNGEN"  ?  +F|foppath("EDICENTER.EINSTELLUNGEN") > 0
.formula P|maskkontextfop = P|maskkontextfop + " fop_artikelakte"  ? _F|empty(M|kurlleer) & _(P|maskkontextfop/"*fop_artikelakte*")
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
